Known behavioural deviations
----------------------------

 [X] filter  a procedure data source is read eagerly -- run to end-of-data when
     the filter is created, not as it is read -- and only in the two-operand
     form; a procedure that never ends is bounded by limitcheck.
 [X] SubFileDecode  a zero count with an empty EOD string passes zero bytes
     (PLRM), where some interpreters read to end-of-file.

 Reals are IEEE single precision (PLRM 3.3.2 permits single or double): results
 carry about seven significant figures and large values print in exponent form
 (4e+09).
